---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const capabilities = ['Regional market development support', 'Solution engineering', 'Pre-sales engineering', 'Proof-of-concept delivery', 'Enterprise deployment', 'Integration and migration', 'Customer enablement', 'Professional services', 'Operational and lifecycle support'];
---

<Layout title="Technology Partnerships | Catdev" description="Partner with Catdev for solution engineering, enterprise implementation, integration and professional services around enterprise software.">
  <section class="enterprise-grid border-b border-white/10 pt-36 pb-20 md:pt-44 md:pb-28"><div class="container-custom"><p class="eyebrow">Technology partnerships</p><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl">Technical capability around your product.</h1><p class="section-copy mt-7 max-w-3xl">Catdev works with technology vendors that need credible solution engineering, implementation and professional services capabilities around their products.</p><a href="/contact" class="btn-primary mt-8">Partner with Catdev</a></div></section>

  <section class="section-padding"><div class="container-custom"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">For technology vendors</p><h2 class="section-title">Extend product capability into customer delivery.</h2><p class="section-copy mt-6">A successful enterprise product engagement rarely stops at the license. Customers also need technical discovery, architecture, deployment, integration, migration and operational ownership.</p><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-steel">Catdev is building relationships with selected enterprise technology vendors where deep engineering and direct customer delivery create more value than transactional resale alone.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 reveal">{capabilities.map((item, index) => <div class="rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] p-5"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-cyan">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><p class="mt-3 font-medium leading-relaxed text-white">{item}</p></div>)}</div></div></div></section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] section-padding"><div class="container-custom"><div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2"><article class="card-glass p-8"><p class="eyebrow">For customers</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white">One accountable technical path.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-steel">Catdev can provide the architecture, integration, implementation and lifecycle work surrounding selected enterprise technologies—reducing the gap between product acquisition and production use.</p></article><article class="card-glass p-8"><p class="eyebrow">For vendors</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Engineering-led market execution.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-steel">Engage a partner able to communicate technically with customers, deliver proofs of concept and take responsibility for implementation and professional services.</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="section-padding"><div class="container-custom"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center"><p class="eyebrow">Partnership fit</p><h2 class="section-title">Selective, technically grounded and transparent.</h2><p class="section-copy mt-6">Catdev does not present unverified vendor affiliations. Named partnerships will appear here only when a formal relationship exists. If your product benefits from strong implementation and integration capability, we should talk.</p><a href="/contact" class="btn-primary mt-8">Start a partner conversation</a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
